{"id":856,"date":"2020-07-15T01:19:28","date_gmt":"2020-07-15T01:19:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/?post_type=rdrcnews&#038;p=856"},"modified":"2020-07-17T20:58:19","modified_gmt":"2020-07-17T20:58:19","slug":"rdrc-interise-two-programs-interise-strong-interise-stronger","status":"publish","type":"rdrcnews","link":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/rdrcnews\/rdrc-interise-two-programs-interise-strong-interise-stronger\/","title":{"rendered":"RDRC Amplify Queens NOW\/Interise Stronger"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Interise Strong &amp; Interise Stronger: Immediate Results, Long-Term Impact<\/span><\/p>\n<p><!--more--><span style=\"color: #000080;\">The COVID-19 pandemic has left our country and our economy shaken. Small businesses, the engine of job creation in the nation, have been hit hard \u2013 businesses located in low-income areas or owned by people of color have been hit even harder. <\/span><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><span style=\"color: #993300;\"><a style=\"color: #993300;\" href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1OxomO5Ta7esH1aunil70BWviXVkNBc0b\/view?usp=sharing\"><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">START NOW, LEARN MORE FROM THE AMPLIFY QUEENS STREETWISE MBA CURRICULUM OVERVIEW DECK<\/span><\/a><a style=\"color: #993300;\" href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1OxomO5Ta7esH1aunil70BWviXVkNBc0b\/view?usp=sharing\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\">!<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">With containment policies likely in place for the next 18 months, businesses must react quickly and plan for the long term. To support small businesses to adapt, we are now offering two online programs:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Interise STRONG is an immediate boost for businesses \u2013 with tactical steps for survival.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000080;\">StreetWise STRONG delivers immediate resources and then continues to work hand-in-hand with businesses.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: #993300;\"><a style=\"color: #993300;\" href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1oRMHGyqTZefmlahudpjMojW0MFE-lVTG\/view\"><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">See our Amplify Queens Open House June 20th Video&#8230;Watch Later&#8230;Share&#8230;Copy Link.<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">To date, we have served hundreds of businesses with Interise STRONG resources. Business owners can sign up immediately to be placed in an upcoming Interise STRONG cohort. Partners, contact us to make an Interise STRONGER program available to businesses in your city.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">There\u2019s no time to waste. Cities need immediate and trusted programs to ensure their small businesses have the resources needed to stay operational, retain employees, and focus on recovery. <span style=\"color: #b87614;\">REGISTER NOW FOR BOTH PROGRAMS!!!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #993300;\"><a style=\"color: #993300;\" href=\"https:\/\/interise.org\/programs\/interise-strong\/?utm_source=Interise+Network&amp;utm_campaign=d2cae4174b-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2019_05_01_05_31_COPY_03&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_93c9db1cda-d2cae4174b-124244885&amp;mc_cid=d2cae4174b&amp;mc_eid=703703dd33\"><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Business Owners: Click to Register for Interise STRONG<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/interise.org\/stronger\/?utm_source=Interise+Network&amp;utm_campaign=d2cae4174b-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2019_05_01_05_31_COPY_03&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_93c9db1cda-d2cae4174b-124244885&amp;mc_cid=d2cae4174b&amp;mc_eid=703703dd33\">Partners: Click to learn MORE about Interise STRONGER<\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/interise.org\/amplify-queens-now\/\">Click to Register for Amplify Queens Interest Form<\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/interise.org\/amplifyqueens-form-submitted\/\">Click to Register for Amplify Queens Streetwise MBA Program<\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">For more detailed information, please contact Malcolm Harewood, <span style=\"color: #993300;\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\">email<\/span> <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"mharewood@rdrc.org\">mharewood@rdrc.org<\/a><\/span><\/span>, or call <span style=\"color: #b87614;\">718.526.3093<\/span>.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Immediate Results. Long-Term Impact!!!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Interise Strong &amp; Interise Stronger: Immediate Results, Long-Term Impact<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":857,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"class_list":["post-856","rdrcnews","type-rdrcnews","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/rdrcnews\/856","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/rdrcnews"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/rdrcnews"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/857"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=856"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}